<title>FRANCE: Paris court to make Eurotunnel statement.</title>
<headline>Paris court to make Eurotunnel statement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the Paris commercial court, Jean-Pierre Mattei, plans to make a statement on Eurotunnel SA/Plc on Wednesday morning, a court spokesman said.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel earlier announced it had reached an agreement in principle with bankers on a restructuring of its debt.</p>
<p>The Paris court president appointed Robert Badinter and Lord Wakeham as mediators to help negotiate a refinancing of Eurotunnel's debt. Their mediation mission ended on Monday.</p>
</text>
